::  modules/harness/glow/gate-session-zeroize.glow -- Session Zeroize!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  gate-session-zeroize
  |=  [cleared=@ud residual=@ud safe-ok=@ud]            ::  160 B, 0 left
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  verified bytes
  ~|  'scorpio-session-zeroize-residual-or-safe-breach' ::  clean DRAM
  ?>  &(gte(cleared 160) eql(residual 0) eql(safe-ok 1))
  cleared
--
